The delay is bounded to 0..=86400000 and each instance may own at most 256 active timers.
An interval uses 1..=86400000, coalesces them into one callback, and reports missed periods saturating at u32::MAX.
The callback is delivered between guest calls on the instance's guest thread.
set-timeout: func; set-interval: func; clear: func; timer-fired: func.
Errors include resource-exhausted and internal-error.
